  "prompts": {
    "image": "Edit image 1 into a clear START FRAME of magical use of a purchased A-38 document. Image 1 fixes exact first-person customer's hands, charcoal sleeves, upright black smartphone, glass shop counter with cameras below, Wlodek blurred green-vest torso and lighting. Image 2 fixes exact burgundy leather folder, parchment, eagle, stamps, gold seal and readable words PODANIE O POWTÓRKĘ and A-38. Left hand still holds phone upright on screen left, ALL screen corners visible. Change right hand from pointing to naturally pinching the OUTER RIGHT EDGE of the complete A-38 folder with thumb in front and fingers behind, holding it above counter on screen right. Folder angled diagonally down-left so its LOWER LEFT CORNER just TOUCHES the middle-right region of phone's display. This is deliberate physical contact and hand is far from contact point. Document face and label readable; no duplication left on table. A SMALL restrained luminous GOLDEN VORTEX centered exactly where corner touches display, 3cm wide, thin spiral filaments; gold seal on folder softly begins glowing. A narrow golden light thread connects seal to contact corner along paper surface. No deformation yet beyond tiny curl of touching corner: entire folder mostly intact and held. Phone display otherwise dark blank, no invented UI or list. Warm gold bounce on fingers, phone bezel and nearby glass, controlled highlights, no large flash, no flames, no fog. Clear empty space around right fingers for eventual release, two anatomically correct hands only. Same composition and photographic realism, vertical 9:16 1080x1920 single film frame, no captions or watermark.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Cały A-38 wraz z teczką wciągnięty do ekranu. Prawa dłoń pusta i rozluźniona, złota pieczęć z orłem widoczna w ekranie, ostatnie iskry gasną.",
    "animation": "0.00–0.40s: the right hand feeds the folder's lower-left corner into the existing golden vortex at the display. 0.40–1.95s: parchment and burgundy cover curl together into one narrowing spiral pulled inside the screen; the right fingers release naturally as the material leaves their grip. Only the document deforms. 1.95–2.20s: seal, clip and strings follow completely inside; the vortex closes into the eagle seal on the display. 2.20–3.00s: match End, hold the empty relaxed right hand and steady phone as sparks fade. Camera: locked POV. Preserve hands, phone and shop; lettering stays intact until absorbed. No duplicated document, scraps, invented UI, hand morphing, cuts or obscuring flash. Leave a clear finished-state handle for choosing the edit by shift.\n@Image1 locks the existing A-38 folder, lettering and eagle seal before absorption. Only this existing document is consumed; never create a replacement or duplicate."
